MODULE: ServedMonotoneScanHighWaterAtFloor
TARGET: ServedMonotone
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the rebuild records its resume floor rather than its scan point as the high-water mark, so the catch-up replay regresses keys the scanned generation already served
PERTURBS: RebuildScan

--- FIND
    /\ rbVal' = SrcState(rbTree) /\ rbHw' = Len(logs[rbTree])
--- REPLACE
    /\ rbVal' = SrcState(rbTree) /\ rbHw' = rbFloor
--- END